            {
                "entry_id": "4b2de7f0-ae9b-3493-91f3-270fe32297b1",
                "word": "trentenaire",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "da69620b-14bd-45f3-91c0-8ae5fefa3c81",
                        "entry_id": "4b2de7f0-ae9b-3493-91f3-270fe32297b1",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "trentenaires"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "20ec509a-b045-3362-b971-a868de56cb7a",
                        "entry_id": "4b2de7f0-ae9b-3493-91f3-270fe32297b1",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne qui a trente ans ou un peu plus."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "5422d4e1-6752-4264-9b30-f2de748a42c5",
                                "sense_id": "20ec509a-b045-3362-b971-a868de56cb7a",
                                "text": "Beaucoup de ces trentenaires auraient certainement apprécié qu'il leur proposât la botte, mais il était certain qu'elles ne pourraient pas lui offrir le plaisir procuré par ses jeunes amantes."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "88189940-8281-4ad9-baaa-076334e838ad",
                                "sense_id": "20ec509a-b045-3362-b971-a868de56cb7a",
                                "text": "Le trentenaire, 22 mentions au casier, a été reconvoqué quelques jours plus tard, en attente des résultats des tests sanguins."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "6aa22686-2f29-4770-a9dc-d5f73600f7ad",
                                "sense_id": "20ec509a-b045-3362-b971-a868de56cb7a",
                                "text": "Avec Ceci est mon corps, Agathe Charnet explore la question des violences sexistes et sexuelles, mais aussi les questionnements d’une trentenaire, ses désirs et ses joies, avec humour et espièglerie."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "670613b3-8676-403e-a8a7-2a5a313e879c",
                        "source_entry_id": "4b2de7f0-ae9b-3493-91f3-270fe32297b1",
                        "source_sense_id": "20ec509a-b045-3362-b971-a868de56cb7a",
                        "target_lang_word": "tricenarian",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "tricenarian",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "aea65947-8b55-3698-9825-4427a14fa9f1",
                                        "entry_id": "cd2ce5eb-1b9e-321b-a08e-97bf8137c06c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The highest rank and pay grade for prefectures in Ancient Rome."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9211a2a9-359a-4d77-bc19-0d102b1ea1cc",
                                                "sense_id": "aea65947-8b55-3698-9825-4427a14fa9f1",
                                                "text": "Following the reign of Scptimius Severus (193-211), the emperor's patrimonium, his personal properties, was merged with a new department, the ratio privata (private accounts) headed by the magister rationis summae privatae at the tricenarian level."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "410204d8-17bc-448b-a2fd-4e71afeee467",
                                                "sense_id": "aea65947-8b55-3698-9825-4427a14fa9f1",
                                                "text": "In the honorific inscription CIL to his son-in-law he is described as vir perfectissimae memoriae, and thus must have risen to tricenarian rank."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e96a6721-522b-4568-9564-d90ac4a927d0",
                                                "sense_id": "aea65947-8b55-3698-9825-4427a14fa9f1",
                                                "text": "At first there were three pay levels: sexagenarian (sixty thousand sesterces), centernarian (one hundred thousand sesterces), and duocenarian (two hundred thousand sesterces). At the end of the second century a fourth level was added, tricenarian (three hundred thousand sesterces). The procurators never went higher than duocenarian; the directors of imperial offices, originally at the duocenarian level, were raised to tricenarian."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "bc68f39e-f9ce-339c-b460-64c8c566d3c4",
                                        "entry_id": "cd2ce5eb-1b9e-321b-a08e-97bf8137c06c",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A person in their thirties, a person aged between 30 and 39 years (inclusive)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d9ec62f4-3f91-42d5-b66a-6d44116da471",
                                                "sense_id": "bc68f39e-f9ce-339c-b460-64c8c566d3c4",
                                                "text": "« I sure hope so » agreed the tricenarian, « it would be a real shame to have been on this island without having really seen its treasures » he observed, his attitude revealing that he actually expected the unsatisfactory outcome."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bc35f4df-293f-4d79-be9e-5f1fc6061df0",
                                                "sense_id": "bc68f39e-f9ce-339c-b460-64c8c566d3c4",
                                                "text": "(see title) Celebrate 30 to 39 years old and show your love for the best dad, daddy, mom, mother, stepdad, papa, stepmom, uncle, aunt godmother or godfather ever with this themed Thirty 3Oth Gifts Tricenarian birthday notebook planner."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b86a061b-a8ba-4657-8cad-103c03aaaa25",
                                                "sense_id": "bc68f39e-f9ce-339c-b460-64c8c566d3c4",
                                                "text": "It was that sentiment that attracted freshly minted thirty-year-old Pia Dickenson. Seventeen divorces in such a milestone year had left the blonde-haired and rosy-cheeked tricenarian with ample emotional baggage, along with a discontent toward her use of her youthful years spelled out in scarlet letters."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
